WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Step one. Above the brow.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Start between the eyebrows.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Make each movement one small, complete circle.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Then move outward.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
This is not a side-to-side wiggle.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
One full pass outward counts as one.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.000
We will do three.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
Okay, let's begin.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
The starting point is here.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
First small circle. Keep moving outward.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
Keep each circle complete.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
At the tail of the brow — lift.

00:27.000 --> 00:28.000
Back to the start.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Pass two.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
Pass three.

00:37.000 --> 00:38.000
After the three passes,

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
come to the middle of the brow —

00:41.000 --> 00:43.000
about one thumb-width

00:43.000 --> 00:45.000
higher.
